==German==

===Etymology===
From {{suffix|de|Fasch|-ieren}}. The former is a dialectal pronunciation of {{m|de|Farce||mince used as stuffing}}, from {{der|de|fr|farce}}. {{doublet|de|farcieren|t1=to stuff with mince}}.

